{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1202130-historical-oddities","id":1202130,"title":"Historical Oddities","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-01T21:55:44-07:00","id":1202130,"title":"Historical Oddities","content":"The World of Darkness has a reputation for attributing just about every historical event or figure that was even moderately strange to supernatural involvement. More recent editions have tried to tone that down, but I think that's a shame. Lean into it! History can be a rich well from which to draw inspiration!<br /> <br /> In this thread, I'd like to start a place where people can post whatever supernatural conspiracies were behind various spooky and bizarre historical events. (As a bonus, we all get a weird history lesson!)<br /> <br /> So, what have you got?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-01T21:59:14-07:00","id":1202131,"title":"","content":"Wasn't the Tunguska 'splosion the result of a climactic battle where the Garou of Russia cornered one of the Zmei?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-01T22:02:47-07:00","id":1202132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1202130-historical-oddities?p=1202131#post1202131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wasn't the Tunguska 'splosion the result of a climactic battle where the Garou of Russia cornered one of the Zmei?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe in Werewolf. In Mage, it was the Void Engineers accidentally activating a gravity-manipulating alien superweapon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-01T22:07:22-07:00","id":1202135,"title":"","content":"Wow really? Neat, what book was that in?<br /> <br /> <br /> Well how about neanderthals were actually genocided because the Godqueen of the Spiders ordered the neanderthal werespiders to round them all up and eat them in one big orgy of destruction thousands of years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-01T22:12:58-07:00","id":1202137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1202130-historical-oddities?p=1202135#post1202135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow really? Neat, what book was that in?</div> </div> </div> </div>Beyond the Barriers.<br /> <br /> I don't know if it's still canon, but I sure hope so.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1202130-historical-oddities?p=1202135#post1202135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Well how about neanderthals were actually genocided because the Godqueen of the Spiders ordered the neanderthal werespiders to round them all up and eat them in one big orgy of destruction thousands of years ago.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br /> <br /> Huh. So there were neanderthal Fera? That's pretty neat.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T08:15:46-07:00","id":1202225,"title":"","content":"I think the explanation given in Rage Across Russia was a Siberian Dreamspeaker Mage battling one of the Zmei. <br /> <br /> Jack the Ripper was a Spectre possessing random people.<br /> <br /> JFK was killed by the Virtual Adepts as part of their initiation test to join the Traditions. <br /> <br /> Richard III actually killed his nephews because they were widderslainte.<br /> <br /> Amelia Earhart was actually a Glasswalker of the Umbral Fliers camp and flew off into the Deep Umbra. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T15:29:59-07:00","id":1202317,"title":"","content":"Some historical figures are more obvious than others. It isn't really a problem for people like Nikola Tesla, the prototypical Son of Ether. But the waters are usually a little muddier than that. Like, it's obvious that Elizabeth Bathory was <i>some </i>kind of vampire, but what kind? Arguments can be made for <i>at least </i>Tremere, Toreador or Ventrue. And then there's Rasputin, who has been claimed by at least four vampire clans, a mage tradition, a werewolf tribe and a wraith faction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T20:43:42-07:00","id":1202428,"title":"","content":"I actually would have liked it if Revised didn't take such a 180 and pretty much said nobody was a supernatural. I mean it kind of gave the impression that you couldn't change the world if you tried, and the important historical figures are just special. I like the idea that say Tesla and Edison were warring Willworkers. Newton doesn't have to be, he could work rather well as someone the order backed from the shadows, but Pythagoras seems a perfect fit for an ancient Willworker.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> That said Gojira is based on a true story, the Dragon Prince of the Realm of Umi who is mad and tainted by Nuclear weaponry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T22:20:18-07:00","id":1202453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1202130-historical-oddities?p=1202225#post1202225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Richard III actually killed his nephews because they were widderslainte.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is awesome. I am going to steal this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","user":"Black Fox","date":".  typo fixed 04-05-2018, 09:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T22:32:08-07:00","id":1202456,"title":"","content":"Inclusion of real world events and people in the supernatural is something that requires a deft touch. I've found that examples in canonical products tend to produce eye rolling, but individual ST decisions to do so at the local gaming table tend to win kudos. Probably because individual STs know the sweet spots of their gaming groups, and that it is why to make each ST chronicle unique.<br /> <br /> In my chronicles the Black Death (and several other plagues like the Antonine and Justinian) were a consequence of the rising/awakening of the Cappadocian antedeluvian. I wanted a sense in my games that the appearance of an antedeluvian would coincide, or even cause, the kind of events that Gehenna (aka the end of the world) should cause. It also provided a rationale among some of the Anarchs that they needed to destroy the remaining slumbering antedeluvians.<br /> <br /> Ancient Garou and their kinfolk were a major reason for the Bronze Age Collapse. It was their big attempt to destroy civilization, and they failed.<br /> <br /> The ghost of Abraham Lincoln is a major power of the Hierarchy in the Washington DC Necropolis since he has memoriam up the wazoo, and his ghost is responsible for making sure the forces of Oblivion can't push the White House into starting a nuclear war.<br /> <br /> However, I'm less likely to use actual historical figures as characters in my games as I use fictional versions of them roman-a-clef style. Lincoln is an exception since ghost sightings of him is real world ghost lore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T07:51:15-07:00","id":1202581,"title":"","content":"Okay, so a couple more historical musings:<br /> <br /> - The Tsabo Maneaters were a couple of overzealous Simba trying to protect a Cairn.<br /> <br /> - The Nameless Thing of Berkeley Square was an Earthbound Demon.<br /> <br /> - Pharaoh Akhenaten (himself genetically contaminated by the Ka Luon) was either a pawn of the Wyrm in an early experiment with monotheism or a last-ditch attempt by God to convert the Egyptians (possibly both). Either way, the forces with their hooks in him tore apart his soul post-mortem, explaining why Akhenaten himself has little direct legacy among the Amenti.<br /> <br /> - William Desmond Taylor was a Malkavian Ghoul who was unceremoniously disposed of when his master grew bored of him, thus explaining his amnesia.<br /> <br /> - Gobekli Tepe, the Sphinx and the Bimini Road were constructed during the Time of Babel, making them the last remaining manmade structures that predate the Impergium.<br /> <br /> - Lt. Col. Jack Churchill was a(n awesome) Marauder.<br /> <br /> - Adam Weishaupt was one of the last remaining Craftmasons and did, in fact, end up killing and replacing a young George Washington, as many conspiracy theorists have speculated. (Thus making the Craftmasons the true architects of the United States.)<br /> <br /> - The Dyatlov Pass hikers were Dominated by Baba Yaga.<br /> <br /> - Both Anastasia Romanov and Elvis Presley became extremely powerful Puppeteers after death, explaining the huge number of post-mortem sightings both had. (Discounting the rogue Progenitor that occasionally attempts to clone Elvis.)<br /> <br /> - King Louis XIV's half brother was a Nosferatu, thus why he spent most of his life in his iconic iron mask.<br /> <br /> - The whole thing about Walt Disney's frozen head is 100% true. In fact, he's still conscious and is a high ranking member of the NWO.<br /> <br /> - The 1936 War of the Worlds broadcast is all that remains of a totally real alien invasion attempt that was wiped out by Paradox.<br /> <br /> - The Comte de Saint Germain was a Toreador who went into hiding after nearly compromising his Masquerade. He resurfaced briefly in 1971 under the pseudonym D.B Cooper.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":12001,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","user":"The Nilbog","date":". 04-03-2018, 11:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T15:11:02-07:00","id":1202756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Nilbog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1202130-historical-oddities?p=1202581#post1202581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">- Both Anastasia Romanov and Elvis Presley became extremely powerful Puppeteers after death, explaining the huge number of post-mortem sightings both had. (Discounting the rogue Progenitor that occasionally attempts to clone Elvis.)</div> </div> </div> </div>When I've run Pulp Era games (late 20s to about '41), I've made Anastasia the Silver Fangs period signature character, with her own pack that, along side Vik Stryker's pack in Silent Striders and Past Lives, serves as potential allies or rivals for the PCs. I admit that this is mostly because I'm a fan of the Don Bluth movie, but also when thinking of suitable period archetypes that fit well with each Tribe's overall concept/archetype, the &quot;surviving czarina&quot; idea just seemed too much fun to pass up. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T21:12:12-07:00","id":1202863,"title":"","content":"Anastasia was canonically saved to go off and Adventure as a silver fang..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T14:02:23-07:00","id":1203127,"title":"","content":"There's a lot of opportunities for events that occurred in the last 15 years. Some might consider it bad taste, but eh. It don't believe in &quot;too soon&quot;. An example would be the Fukushima disaster. Or, more recently, the Russian interference in world elections. Perhaps Putin is under the influence of some nefarious faction of supernaturals who are using technology to destabilize the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24088-thespiraleffect","name":"thespiraleffect","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}